        "text": "Base rate/reference class: using the same Exhibit 1 seasonally adjusted not price adjusted deficit variant, the last 12 available monthly deficits from June 2025 through May 2026 average about $60.7B, while the first five months of 2026 average about $59.6B and the March-May 2026 moving average is $62.9B."
